<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were steady. Trading moderarely active. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1150-1420 lbs</p>
<p>64.50-66.00.  Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 63.50-64.50.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 62.50-63.50.  Select and Choice Holsteins 1-2</p>
<p>1300-1500 lbs 57.00-58.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers:  High Select and Choice 2-3 1025-1125 lbs 64.00-65.25.  Select and Choice 2-3 950-1100 lbs 62.50-64.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 61.50-62.50.</p>
</text>
